YAP CPU memory port LAT_MEM=1 PHYSICAL-CPU-014
* Behavioral 32-bit word at addr 0. we+clk samples wdata; re drives rdata.
.subckt MEMBIT d we q vdd gnd
S1 d q we 0 icwe
Cq q 0 1n
Rq q 0 1T
.model icwe SW(vt=1.65 vh=0.4 ron=1 roff=1T)
.ends MEMBIT
VDD VDD 0 DC 3.3
VVSS VSS 0 DC 0
Vclk clk 0 PWL(0 0 50u 0 52u 3.3 80u 3.3 82u 0 150u 0)
Vwe we 0 PWL(0 3.3 80u 3.3 82u 0 150u 0)
Vre re 0 PWL(0 0 90u 0 92u 3.3 150u 3.3)
Vsz0 sz0 0 DC 0
Vsz1 sz1 0 DC 3.3
Vw0 wdata0 0 DC 3.3
Vw1 wdata1 0 DC 0
